      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "The change dictionary in a notification sent before a change always contains an [`notificationIsPriorKey`](nskeyvaluechangekey/notificationispriorkey.md) entry whose value is an `NSNumber` object that contains the Boolean value [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true), but never contains an [`newKey`](nskeyvaluechangekey/newkey.md) entry.",
